# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
# Short, printable links for the leaflet, QR codes, and anywhere a long URL won't fit.
# Format: <from> <to> [status]. 302 (temporary) is deliberate — the Google appointment
# link can be regenerated, and a 301 would stay cached in visitors' browsers.
#
# NOTE: /book and /demo are now served by functions/book.js and functions/demo.js, which count the
# click before redirecting. A Pages Function takes precedence over this file, and _redirects rules are
# NOT applied to a request a Function serves — so the two rules below are currently INERT. They are
# kept deliberately as a fallback: delete the Functions and these resume working, so the printed QR
# code and leaflet links can never break just because the counting broke.
# Keep the destinations here in sync with the DESTINATION constants in those two files.

